      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mitigations if expert Adam state (~40 GB) won't fit:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mitigations if expert Adam state (~40 GB) won't fit:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Jj3-jMh0J7c0rreyuQRYF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 2082,
      "width": 915.6,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "hz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1640755075,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1361072066,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Lower ep_size to 4 → 2 experts/GPU but expert_dp_group has size 2 → ZeRO can shard expert opt-state 2-way.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Lower ep_size to 4 → 2 experts/GPU but expert_dp_group has size 2 → ZeRO can shard expert opt-state 2-way.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uehkcwXHG8e33hd-TNYSC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 2104,
      "width": 831.6,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "i0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1012221624,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1569942860,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  cpu_offloading: true in YAML → DeepSpeedCPUAdam moves Adam m, v to host RAM (slower step, fits).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  cpu_offloading: true in YAML → DeepSpeedCPUAdam moves Adam m, v to host RAM (slower step, fits).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fnfvMAfmiQOKmI6hciVSS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 2126,
      "width": 520.8,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "i1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 531263671,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 70547623,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Switch to bf16 Adam moments (saves 2/3 of optimizer bytes).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Switch to bf16 Adam moments (saves 2/3 of optimizer bytes).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pOesUORf-IuK_UHNcfbL0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 2148,
      "width": 806.4,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "i2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 81845347,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 972997723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  ZeRO-3 across the full world (shards expert params too, but expensive AllGather every layer).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  ZeRO-3 across the full world (shards expert params too, but expensive AllGather every layer).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
